OL,3,GNEWSAPolice given more time to quiz
OL,4,AManchester plot suspects
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives have been granted an extra
OL,7,Fweek to question two men arrested as
OL,8,Fpart of an investigation into an
OL,9,Falleged plot to target the Jewish
OL,10,Fcommunity in Manchester.
OL,12,FThe extension means the men - both in
OL,13,Fthe 30s - can now be detained until 4
OL,14,FOctober.
OL,16,FThe men were arrested in the Northern
OL,17,FQuarter area of Manchester on 20
OL,18,FSeptember - the eve of Yom Kippur, when
OL,19,Fthousands of British Jews were in
OL,20,Fsynagogues.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
